OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a few light showers
OL,6,Fat first in the east. Otherwise it
OL,7,Fwill be dry with variable amounts of
OL,8,Fcloud and a few sunny intervals. Light
OL,9,Fnortheasterly wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,12,Fpartly cloudy. The rest of the night
OL,13,Fwill be mainly dry with variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud. Chance of a light
OL,15,Fshower across the east.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,18,Fcloudy at times. Chance of a few light
OL,19,Fshowers across Lothians and Borders.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
